@startuml
title Green Rides Control - Display Journey Details and Manage User Experience

[*] --> Initialised

state Initialised
state LoginAndDestinationSelected
state JourneyDetailsDisplayed
state DrivingModeActivated
state OtherOptionsChosen
state PlaceSelectedForEating
state AccidentOccurred
state JourneyCompleted

Initialised : entry / Display Welcome
JourneyCompleted : entry / Display Journey Complete

Initialised --> LoginAndDestinationSelected : User Login / Get Destination
LoginAndDestinationSelected --> JourneyDetailsDisplayed : Destination Selected / Display Journey Details

JourneyDetailsDisplayed --> DrivingModeActivated : Activate Driving Mode / Start Driving
JourneyDetailsDisplayed --> OtherOptionsChosen : Choose Other Options / Select Option
JourneyDetailsDisplayed --> PlaceSelectedForEating : User Hungry / Select Place to Eat

PlaceSelectedForEating --> JourneyDetailsDisplayed : View Menu / Display Menu
PlaceSelectedForEating --> AccidentOccurred : Accident Occurred / Alert Authorities

DrivingModeActivated --> AccidentOccurred : Accident Occurred / Alert Authorities
OtherOptionsChosen --> AccidentOccurred : Accident Occurred / Alert Authorities

JourneyDetailsDisplayed --> AccidentOccurred : Accident Occurred / Alert Authorities
AccidentOccurred --> JourneyCompleted : Incident Handled / Display Incident Complete

JourneyDetailsDisplayed --> JourneyCompleted : Journey Completed / Display Journey Complete
PlaceSelectedForEating --> JourneyCompleted : Order Placed / Display Order Complete
DrivingModeActivated --> JourneyCompleted : Driving Mode Ended / Display Driving Mode End
OtherOptionsChosen --> JourneyCompleted : Option Chosen / Display Option Chosen

JourneyCompleted --> [*] : After (Elapsed Time)\n[Closedown Not Requested]

@enduml
